  <item nodeId="node-0x56436d18aea0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">- start -</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">



You are Jim Holden, Captain of the infamous Rocinante. You sit on the bridge, head aching and mouth tasting of sour copper. Standing with a groan you say, &quot;Alex, bridge is yours I need a coffee. Want me to grab you one?&quot; Alex replies, &quot;Copy that cap, but I&apos;ll pass on the cuppa, thanks.&quot; Oh and by the way, I think the galley is running low on coffee.
To complete the game and get captain holden his precious coffee you will need to go to the galley to use the coffee machine
The Expanse - Coffee Time on the Rocinante
An Interactive Fiction by Zachary Geary
Release 1 / Serial number 260414 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D

Bridge
The nerve center of the Roci. Four crash couches face their stations in a semicircle, bathed in the glow of dozens of tactical displays. Above, the curved canopy offers a view of the endless black. The air smells faintly of ozone and recycled atmosphere. Everything here speaks to the ship&apos;s Martian military heritage - efficient, deadly, and built to last.

&gt;</result>
