  <item nodeId="node-0x5626ad83b840">
    <command xml:space="preserve">go up</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You pull yourself up the rungs to the deck above...

Bridge
The command center of the ship. The central ladder well begins here, dropping down into the belly of the ship.

You would have to get out of the Bridge first.

